                                                "sense_id": "e6b2d0b0-4780-3e06-af64-e5d2e6e867ee",
                                                "text": "In the southern hemisphere the flow of air around a low-pressure system is clockwise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0ccfaa1-29b0-40b0-8749-7e7d161b17e8",
                                                "sense_id": "e6b2d0b0-4780-3e06-af64-e5d2e6e867ee",
                                                "text": "The clockwise beating of cilia results in a net flow of extraembryonic fluid leftwards […]"
